Subject: [PATCH] Unify Tab typography and padding across inline preedit modes

---
 INSTALL-PATCH.md               |  2 +-
 REWRITE-UI.md                  |  2 ++
 WeaselUI/HorizontalLayout.cpp  |  7 ++++---
 WeaselUI/VerticalLayout.cpp    |  7 ++++---
 WeaselUI/WeaselPanel.cpp       |  5 ++---
 rewrite-build.txt              |  2 +-
 test/rewrite_pipeline_test.cpp | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/INSTALL-PATCH.md b/INSTALL-PATCH.md
index 6d7b882..cea4283 100644
--- a/INSTALL-PATCH.md
+++ b/INSTALL-PATCH.md
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ patch:
 
 把这三项合并到现有 `patch:` 下，不要覆盖整份配置。修改后重新部署并重启小狼毫服务。部分应用可能忽略线型或颜色。
 
-完整示例见 `inline-underline.custom.example.yaml`。当前构建：`rewrite-ui-yaml-inline-underline-20261002`。
+完整示例见 `inline-underline.custom.example.yaml`。当前构建：`rewrite-ui-unified-tab-spacing-20261003`。
 
 ## 输入异常排查
 
diff --git a/REWRITE-UI.md b/REWRITE-UI.md
index 744327c..d1bee15 100644
--- a/REWRITE-UI.md
+++ b/REWRITE-UI.md
@@ -364,3 +364,5 @@ Start-Process 'C:\Program Files\Rime\weasel-0.17.4\WeaselServer.exe'
 线型可选 `none`、`solid`、`dot`、`dash`、`squiggle`。颜色用带引号的 `#RRGGBB`，或 `theme` 跟随当前皮肤选中候选的背景色；透明背景回退到蓝色。与传统皮肤数值颜色的字节顺序不同。非法线型或颜色分别回退为实线或默认蓝色。只影响 TSF 行内编码，不调整候选框。
 
 修改后重新部署并重启小狼毫服务；首次安装新版 DLL 后须重开输入应用。后续仅调整 YAML 不需重装。文本宿主最终决定显示效果，个别应用可能忽略 TSF 的线型或颜色。完整示例随包提供：`inline-underline.custom.example.yaml`。
+
+2026-10-03：inline_preedit 开启和关闭时，Tab 共用字号、预留行高、上下 padding 和候选间距；普通非行内编码的布局保持原样。
diff --git a/WeaselUI/HorizontalLayout.cpp b/WeaselUI/HorizontalLayout.cpp
index 1b46eb3..a03474d 100644
--- a/WeaselUI/HorizontalLayout.cpp
+++ b/WeaselUI/HorizontalLayout.cpp
@@ -57,10 +57,11 @@ void HorizontalLayout::DoLayout(CDCHandle dc, PDWR pDWR) {
 
   /* Preedit */
   if (!IsInlinePreedit() && _context.HasPanelPreedit()) {
-    if (!_configuredInlinePreedit) height -= real_margin_y / 2;
+    const bool compactPreedit = !_configuredInlinePreedit || _context.rewrite.active();
+    if (compactPreedit) height -= real_margin_y / 2;
     size = GetPreeditSize(dc, _context.preedit, pDWR->pPreeditTextFormat, pDWR);
     int szx = pgw, szy = max(size.cy, pgh);
-    if (!_configuredInlinePreedit) {
+    if (compactPreedit) {
       // Reserve the same single-line slot for ordinary code and Tab syllables.
       // Multi-line Tab text can still grow naturally within the candidate width.
       CSize codeLine, tabLine;
@@ -75,7 +76,7 @@ void HorizontalLayout::DoLayout(CDCHandle dc, PDWR pDWR) {
                       : 0;
     _preeditRect.SetRect(w, height + yoffset + (szy - size.cy) / 2, w + size.cx,
                          height + yoffset + (szy - size.cy) / 2 + size.cy);
-    const int preeditGap = _configuredInlinePreedit ? _style.spacing : _style.spacing / 2;
+    const int preeditGap = compactPreedit ? _style.spacing / 2 : _style.spacing;
     height += szy + 2 * yoffset + preeditGap;
     width = max(width, (_context.rewrite.active() ? offsetX + real_margin_x :
                         real_margin_x * 2) + size.cx + szx);
